# Found untracked during the 2026-08-27 merge audit: seven hidden
# `.release_*.winsvpn-apple-mod-<content-hash>.py` snapshots of the Apple
# cross-store gate's REQUIRED_MODULE_FILES support modules. The name
# `winsvpn-apple-mod-` appears in no current source; it is leftover scratch
# from an earlier gate iteration that snapshotted modules to hidden files
# before compiling them. The current gate holds bytes via O_NOFOLLOW
# descriptors and imports under private in-memory module names
# (`apple_cross_store_artifact_gate._load_required_modules`), writing nothing,
# and test_apple_cross_store_gate_adapters.py asserts no
# `.*.winsvpn-apple-mod-*` file may linger after a load. Stale copies are
# never source; ignore the whole shape so a future `git add -A` cannot
# commit the next leftover.
/tools/.*.winsvpn-apple-mod-*

